  "advertText": null,
  "attentionGrabber": null,
  "description": "This 2007 Ford Transit is a practical and reliable commercial vehicle, featuring the 2.2 TDCi 280 Duratorq engine. As a front wheel drive model, this Transit is configured in the L1 H2 body style, offering a balance of load space and accessibility suitable for a variety of transport needs. The vehicle is powered by a 2.2 litre diesel engine, which is well regarded for its efficiency and performance in working environments.\n\nThe TDCi 280 variant is designed to provide a robust solution for those requiring a dependable workhorse. By combining the efficient 2.2 litre diesel engine with the front wheel drive layout, this Transit offers a driving experience that is both stable and responsive, even when carrying a load. The L1 H2 dimensions ensure that the vehicle remains manoeuvrable in tighter spaces while still providing the necessary height and length for cargo, making it a versatile choice for businesses or individuals needing a capable and functional van.",
